# A Hub run from this checkout with APP_DATA_DIR pointing at the repo root writes its app data
# here: one folder per marketplace app (`ci-marketplace/<app>/app.env` holds that app's secrets —
# RabbitMQ, OpenClaw's gateway token, Memory's LLM key) plus the init sentinel. Never commit either.
